    "created_at": "2025-09-15T06:30:19Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-09-15T06:30:19Z",
    "body": "So we should test paths of `/foo/` and `/foo/../bar/` and the latter not showing up at `/bar/`.\n\nWe should also test something like `/€` not showing up at `/%E2%82%AC` (because it doesn't get percent-encoded, only UTF-8 encoded).\n\nThough maybe we should apply percent-encoding since it's a crappy API without it, but starting with tests seems like a good start.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
